  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "軟體測試",
    "sub_ename": "SOFTWARE TESTING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目的是在使學生瞭解軟體品質保證的觀念、理論與實務，特別是在軟體測試方面。在理論方面包括軟體錯誤模式、測試涵蓋、 單元測試、整合測試、測試策略、效能測試、回歸測試、物件測試等主題。在實務方面強調工具的使用，包含功能測試與系統測試。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to teach students the concept, theory and practice of software quality assurance, especially on the software testing. The theory part contains software fault model, testing coverage, unit testing, integration testing, test strategy, performance testing, regression testing and object testing. The practice part contains the practice of functional testing and system testing.",
